## \uc0\u55357 \u56960  Teknoloji Y\u305 \u287 \u305 n\u305  (Hedef)\
- **Frontend:** React 19 (Vite) + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion (Animasyonlar)\
- **Backend:** Node.js (Express) - Vercel Serverless Functions uyumlu\
- **Veritaban\uc0\u305  & Auth:** Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Edge Functions)\
- **Yapay Zeka:** Groq Cloud (Llama-3.3-70b)\
- **Deployment:** GitHub & Vercel\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u57056 \u65039  Temel Komutlar\
- Kurulum: `npm install`\
- Geli\uc0\u351 tirme (Lokal): `npm run dev` (Frontend & Backend e\u351  zamanl\u305 )\
- Build: `npm run build`\
